Credits
-------

* eznix -- eznixOS (https://sourceforge.net/projects/eznixos/): the eznix13X
  live-build base, scripts, and desktop design that JULinux is derived from.
* Justin Breithaupt -- JULinux ("Justin's Linux"): the JULinux 13X edition.
* Ben Fitzpatrick (bfitzgit23) -- StormD (StormOS Debian Edition) and the
  JULinux 13X build adaptation.

Changes requested for JULinux (vs. the eznix13X / StormD base)
--------------------------------------------------------------

* Added the JULinux 13X build with Calamares, switcheroo applet, and
  welcome app (b9607ea76)
* Rewrote the welcome app with install/uninstall tabs and apt progress
  (28a3d4785)
* Switcheroo applet falls back to a window when the tray is unavailable
  (86975b83e)
* Ship flatpak, gnome-software + flathub pre-enabled (e40f3fe2c)
* Dropped kitty -- xfce4-terminal is the only terminal (b2c15a79b)
* Added "The Book of God's Law" desktop shortcut (9c0211e41)

